HAAYE SYEDA ZAINAB HAAYE SYEDA ZAINAB<br>
JAAN-E-KARBALA ZAINAB HAAYE SYEDA ZAINAB<br>
<br>
1.Jin-o-Ins Rotey Hai Kheke Jaan Khote Hai<br>
Wa Musibata Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
2.Baniye Aza Zainab Pheli Zakira Zainab<br>
Haaye Syeda Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
3.Kya Kya Hadesey Guzrey Pusht Par Laagey Durrey<br>
Ruh-e-Fatima Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
4.Deen Ko Tu Rida De Di Bhai Par Fida Kardi<br>
Apne Nounehaal Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
5.Raat Ke Aandhere Me Dushmanou Ke Gherey Me<br>
Dhudhti Hai Kya Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
6.Julm-o-Jor Sehne Ki Ibteda Toh Maa Ne Ki<br>
Tu Hai Inteha Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
7.Bailchey Se Zalim Ne War Hai Kiya Kaisa<br>
Kargayi Qaaza Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab<br>
<br>
8.Kitne Rah Me Bichdhe Kitne Hadesey Guzrey<br>
Tu Ne Sehliya Zainab Haaye Syeda Zainab
